$NetBSD$

NetBSD has no glibc CPU_SETSIZE and the local process backend
stubbed the affinity calls out. Bound the controller mask by the
configured processor count. Implement setAffinity and getAffinity
through the native cpuset and _sched_setaffinity interfaces.
Origin: EmberBSD (AI-assisted), not submitted upstream.

